Subject: [PATCH 05/38] ARM: dts: sk-rzg1m: add Ether pins
Date: Mon, 31 Jul 2017 17:19:17 +0200
Message-Id: <51982d8f4722d1bbc2dabd79d4a1acebb90f6357.1501514100.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
